  "fitting": "Unchanged S4 center algorithms and candidate configurations. Conditional on each fitted center, train-only profile beta on [0,10], as in P0. Truth beta is never supplied to likelihood fitting; beta0 remains the supplied simulation bound used by the center schedule.",
  "partitions": "N is the number of fitting reports, matching S4. Validation and test sets each have ceil(N/3), at least one, independent reports under the same center as their training set. Calibration generates training and validation only. Confirmation uses 100 fresh independent training/test draws; it does not rerun selection. No validation-to-training refit: the fitting budget remains N. These are disjoint sampling roles, not folds of a fixed dataset; tiny-N rounding is explicit.",
